          "bbox": [
            0.247,
            0.12,
            0.886,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": "e. Mayank says, “If we want to know the total number of wickets he has taken in his last 30 matches, we have to add the numbers 0, 1, 2, 3 …, up to 7.” Can Mayank get the total number of wickets taken in this way? Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.247,
            0.214,
            0.885,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "f. How would you correctly figure out the total number of wickets taken by Bumrah in his last 30 matches, using this table?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.286,
            0.884,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": "6. The following pictograph shows the number of tractors in five different villages."
