          "content": "| Villages | Number of Tractors 1 Tractor ) |\n| --- | --- |\n| Village A | TO O O3O |\n| Village B | O3 O O O |\n| Village C | db ob ob ao ao ob ob oo |\n| Village D |  |\n| Village E | O |",
